<programme start="20261113220000 +0000" stop="20261114000000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Northeastern at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Northeastern Huskies (0-1) take on the Virginia Cavaliers (1-0) at John Paul Jones Arena. The Huskies look to rebound after dropping their season opener 93-85 to the Terriers, while the Cavaliers defeated the Dragons 89-60 behind Thijs De Ridder.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114000000 +0000" stop="20261114020000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Troy at NC State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Troy Trojans (1-2) visit the NC State Wolfpack (3-0) at Lenovo Center in Raleigh. Troy enters this matchup after a 74-69 overtime victory over LMU, while NC State seeks to make it four straight wins after a 94-60 win over Presbyterian.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114020000 +0000" stop="20261114040000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Ball State at SMU</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Ball State Cardinals (1-2) battle the SMU Mustangs (3-0) at Moody Coliseum in Dallas, Texas. Ball State enters after beating Brescia 89-64, while SMU remains undefeated this season following a 98-63 victory over Prairie View A&amp;M in its last game.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
