<programme start="20261114200000 +0000" stop="20261114230000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Tennessee at Texas A&amp;M</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 8 Tennessee Volunteers (7-2) visit the Texas A&amp;M Aggies (4-5) at Kyle Field. Tennessee enters this matchup after beating Kentucky 34-6, while Texas A&amp;M seek to snap a two-game skid and fell 17-9 to South Carolina in Week 10.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
