<programme start="20261114231500 +0000" stop="20261115021500 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Florida at Kentucky</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Gators (5-4) take on the No. 11 Wildcats (7-2) at Kroger Field for an SEC game. Kentucky dropped their previous game 34-6 against Tennessee and look to Kenny Minchey, while Florida seek to snap a two-game skid and fell 23-7 to Oklahoma.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
