<programme start="20261115023000 +0000" stop="20261115053000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas Tech at Oklahoma State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 12 Red Raiders (8-1, 5-1) host the No. 25 Cowboys (6-3, 4-2) for a Big 12 showdown. Texas Tech leads the series 25-24-3 after a 42-0 win in 2025. Oklahoma State is third in the FBS at 43.9 points per game. Texas Tech is tied for 14th (37.6).</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
