<programme start="20261114063700 +0000" stop="20261114070400 +0000" channel="Naruto"><title lang="es">Naruto: Increible Verdad: La Identidad De Gaara Emerge</title><sub-title lang="es">Increible Verdad: La Identidad De Gaara Emerge</sub-title><desc lang="es">Shino aparece mientras Sasuke y Kankuro combaten. Dejando que Shino se encargue de Kankuro, Sasuke se enfrenta a Gaara.</desc><credits><actor>Isabel Martion (Naruto Uzumaki)</actor><actor>Christine Byrd (Sakura Haruno)</actor><actor>Victor Ugarte (Sasuke Uchiha)</actor><actor>Alfonso Obreg (Kakashi Hatake)</actor></credits><date>20040310</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Action &amp; Adventure</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.73.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E74</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/5e73b850e40c9f001a0a9fb4/tile.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
