<programme start="20261114210000 +0000" stop="20261114220000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Engineering Catastrophes</title><sub-title lang="en">The Fern Hollow Fiasco</sub-title><desc lang="en">On a snowy morning in Pittsburgh, a messy commute becomes dangerous after a bridge collapses; an investigation reveals how corrosion and other environmental factors helped bring down this decades-old structure.</desc><category lang="en">Science</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15354239_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114220000 +0000" stop="20261114230000 +0000" channel="Sci 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Engineering Catastrophes</title><sub-title lang="en">Blaze of Winston-Salem</sub-title><desc lang="en">A catastrophic fire at a fertilizer plant threatens city-wide devastation in Winston-Salem, N.C.; experts use the latest science to investigate an outdated, wooden storage facility heavily stocked with volatile, explosive chemicals.</desc><category lang="en">Science</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15354239_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
