<programme start="20261114193000 +0000" stop="20261114213000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">New York Rangers at Vancouver Canucks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Vancouver Canucks host the New York Rangers in NHL regular-season play at Rogers Arena. New York leads the season series 1-0 after beating Vancouver 6-2 in its last meeting behind goals from Will Cuylle. Vancouver relies on Elias Pettersson.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114213000 +0000" stop="20261115003000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Winnipeg Jets at Chicago Blackhawks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Chicago Blackhawks host the Winnipeg Jets in NHL regular-season play at the United Center. Winnipeg make the return trip to Chicago after dropping a 4-3 decision there on Oct. 15, while the Jets having won three of the last five meetings overall.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
