<programme start="20261115010000 +0000" stop="20261115040000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Edmonton Oilers at Toronto Maple Leafs</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Toronto Maple Leafs host the Edmonton Oilers in NHL regular-season play at Scotiabank Arena. Toronto have won four of the last five meetings, including a 7-2 rout in Edmonton just three weeks ago. Connor McDavid leads Edmonton in points.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
