<programme start="20261115100000 +0000" stop="20261115110000 +0000" channel="TNT US"><title lang="en">FBI</title><sub-title lang="en">Lineage</sub-title><desc lang="en">When a famous rapper and two teen fans are gunned down on his tour bus, the team discovers there may be more to the story than his feud with another rapper; Isobel hits a major milestone that has her contemplating her future at the Bureau.</desc><credits><actor>Missy Peregrym</actor><actor>Zeeko Zaki</actor><actor>Jeremy Sisto</actor></credits><category lang="en">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p15528073_b_v12_be.jpg"/></programme>
